s", "description": "Federal authorities apprehended a noncitizen accused of illegally voting in multiple U.S. elections over the course of a decade. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) provided Border Hawk with...", "title": "ICE Arrests Italian Citizen for Voting in US Elections - Border Hawk", "url": "https://t.co/ErUXWILSct"}, "replies": 30, "created": 1793726674000, "id": "2117669276966691088", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1924467797544808448/20-3dZrS_normal.jpg", "displayName": "U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement", "username": "ICEgov"}, "content": "ITALIAN CITIZEN ARRESTED IN SANCTUARY NEW JERSEY FOR VOTER FRAUD\n\nAndrea Morzetta, an Italian national, was arrested by ICE and charged with unlawful voting by an alien. Morzetta allegedly cast ballots in four federal elections.\n\nIllegal voting is NOT a paperwork error when", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 1345}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToUNhrOs", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 58, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "god", "id": 8919552, "raw_content": "Hi fellow Patriots,\n\nI know it may not be a good time with the election going on, but I don't know where to reach so many Christians and I know the power of prayers. My mom has just been diagnosed with cancer (sarcoma) in her lungs today. She will have to endure chemo in the next following months. She's the best mom (as all are) and will fight it tooth and nails.\n\nIf you could pray and keep her close to your heart in the next steps of her journey on earth, I would be so honored. Her name is Anne.\n\nThank you.", "author": "uxername27", "created": 1793731877646, "profile_picture": "NreavRYIB637", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "John_Dukes", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Request for prayers", "last_comment_created": 1793734919839, "content": "<p>Hi fellow Patriots,</p>\n<p>I know it may not be a good time with the election going on, but I don't know where to reach so many Christians and I know the power of prayers. My mom has just been diagnosed with cancer (sarcoma) in her lungs today. She will have to endure chemo in the next following months. She's the best mom (as all are) and will fight it tooth and nails.</p>\n<p>If you could pray and keep her close to your heart in the next steps of her journey on earth, I would be so honored. Her name is Anne.</p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 27, "score_up": 58, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\u271d\ufe0f\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0UNDER GOD\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u271d\ufe0f", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToUNhJ6Q", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 84, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "fight", "id": 8919322, "raw_content": "Feels good man", "author": "Addicted2Clickbait", "created": 1793724333781, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Addicted2Clickbait", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "This morning I voted to designate drug and human trafficking ca